  "help.body": "<p><b style=\"color:#4df\">Kutongedza:</b> WASD jambuka. Space = menya. LMB = jambuka panoratidzwa.</p><p><b style=\"color:#8f8\">Anodya ani:</b></p><p>🌱 Miriwo inodya chiedza. 🔵 Vadyi vadiki vanodya miriwo. 🟠 Vadyi vepakati vanosesa bhakteriya+miriwo. 🟣 Vavhimi vakuru vanodya miriwo, bhakteriya nevadyi vepakati — uye vanogona kumenya chakanyanya kukura zvikurusei.</p><p><b style=\"color:#4df\">Khamera:</b> F khamera woga, V dzoka kuselere. Vhiri = zoom.</p><p><b style=\"color:#4df\">Kugovana:</b> Dya, kura, govana. Q = nemaoko.</p>",
